------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Weft web UI: bundled third-party software
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Weft web UI that is embedded in the weft server binary
(internal/weft/webui/static, built from web/weft-ui) bundles third-party npm
packages, among them React, React Router, TanStack Query, Recharts, d3
modules, react-markdown and the unified/remark/micromark libraries. They are
used under the MIT, ISC and BSD-3-Clause licences. Their copyright notices and
licence texts are reproduced in

    internal/weft/webui/static/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt

which ships with the UI and is served by the weft server at
/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt. The file is generated by
scripts/weft_ui_licenses.mjs when the UI is built (make weft-ui).

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Ported code
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

None. Weft implements an API that is compatible with W&B Weave (Apache-2.0),
but its code, prompts and documentation are its own; see
docs/weft/PROVENANCE.md for the scan that checks this and for the decisions
taken.
